      "outputs": [],
      "title": "\ud83d\udc8e Guide: Full-Quality 25-Step 360\u00b0 VR Panorama (2K)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83c\udf10 Qwen-Image-2.1 \u2022 Full-Quality 360\u00b0 VR Panorama (2K)\n\nProduction high-fidelity spherical skybox & VR environment!\n\n### \u2699\ufe0f Pipeline Specifications\n\u2022 **Base Model**: qwen_image_2.1_Q5_K_M.gguf (Qwen-Image 2.1 DiT Backbone)\n\u2022 **360 Panorama LoRA**: pano360_qwen21_edit_v1.safetensors (Gogodr / Poly Haven, Strength 1.0) \u2014 *Essential spherical LoRA mapping scenes into seamless 360\u00b0 equirectangular panoramas!*\n\u2022 **QwenImage21Cache**: Prefix attention caching accelerates 25-step inference to ~60-80s on 8GB GPU!\n\u2022 **Latent**: Dedicated Qwen 360 Panorama Latent (2:1) preset to **2048\u00d71024 (2K VR Production)** for pristine native spherical resolution directly in latent space.\n\u2022 **Sampler**: Native euler / simple at **25 steps**.\n\u2022 **CFG Guidance**: Default 1.0 (fast single-pass). You can increase to 2.0 - 3.0 to strongly amplify prompt adherence.\n\u2022 **Seamless Upscale**: Qwen 360 Panorama Upscale with toroidal boundary wrapping to boost 2K up to **4K Ultra VR (4096\u00d72048)**.\n\u2022 **Interactive 360 Viewer**: Drag to look around in 360\u00b0, scroll to zoom FOV, or toggle auto-rotation.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd00 Dual Modality: Image-to-Pano vs. Text-to-Pano\nThis workflow supports **BOTH** Image-to-Panorama and pure Text-to-Panorama generation:\n\n\u2022 **\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Image-to-Panorama (Default)**:\n  - Load your 2D photo into **[Load Reference Photo]**. It anchors at the center (\u00b0$ yaw) while the AI synthesizes the surrounding 360\u00b0 world.\n\n\u2022 **\u270d\ufe0f Pure Text-to-Panorama (Text Only)**:\n  1. Select **[Load Reference Photo]** and press **Ctrl + M** to **Bypass / Mute** it (or disconnect the wire leading into Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1).\n  2. In **[Qwen 360 Panorama Prompt]**, describe your complete 360\u00b0 scene environment.\n  3. Click **Queue Prompt**: Qwen synthesizes a pristine 360\u00b0 VR world from scratch purely from your text prompt!"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# \ud83c\udf10 Qwen-Image-2.1 \u2022 Full-Quality 360\u00b0 VR Panorama\n\nProduction high-fidelity spherical skybox & VR environment!\n\n\u2022 **Model**: `qwen_image_2.1_Q5_K_M.gguf` (Zero LoRAs \u2014 pure native base DiT math)\n\u2022 **QwenImage21Cache**: Prefix attention caching accelerates 25-step inference to ~60-80s on 8GB GPU!\n\u2022 **Sampler**: Native `euler` / `simple` at **25 steps**\n\u2022 **CFG Guidance Knob**: Default `1.0` (fast single-pass). You can increase to `2.0 - 3.0` to strongly amplify prompt adherence.\n\u2022 **Resolution**: Choose `1536x768` (2:1) or `1568x672` (21:9 Ultrawide), followed by instant upscale to 2K.\n\u2022 **Interactive 360 Viewer**: Drag to look around in 360\u00b0, scroll to zoom FOV, or toggle auto-rotation."
      },
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
